<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gaylord cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gaylord cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it cut its rating of Gaylord Entertainment Co to neutral from a prior rating of outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares slipped 3/8 to 21-3/8 in early trading.</p>
